  m_text: 'The player must control a ball that moves along platforms. The task is
    to press the platforms in time to change their places and move the ball further.
    Each level becomes more and more exciting: the speed of the ball increases, and
    the number of platforms increases, creating real tests for reaction and strategy.
    Manage to react to changes and do not let the ball fall! Pave the way to victory,
    overcoming increasingly difficult obstacles and opening new levels in this exciting
    arcade game!'
